{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPolygon(cm)multiPolygonWithPolygons:"},"abstract":[{"text":"Creates and returns a multipolygon object consisting of the given polygons.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"instancetype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray","text":"NSArray<MLNPolygon *>","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"polygons","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"polygons","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The array of polygons defining the shape.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new multipolygon object."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon\/multipolygonwithpolygons:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon\/multiPolygonWithPolygons:"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation